  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating Forced Labor and Labor Trafficking of Adults and Children in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build the capacity of the government and businesses to expand and better coordinate ongoing labor trafficking enforcement efforts in Ghana. By putting the right tools in the hands of labor inspectors, business owners, organizations providing social services and workers, the project will help promote supply chains free of exploitative labor and a fair playing field for workers in the United States around the world.</narrative>
  </description>
